"""
RAG Retrieval Pipeline v15.0 — Farhat Abbas University Sétif 1
===============================================================
Complete rewrite with automatic graph-aware retrieval:
  - Automatically detects academic entities in queries
  - Traverses the matched node + all descendants
  - Boosts chunks under matched nodes for better relevance
  - Falls back to global search when no node match found

Requires:
  pip install sentence-transformers neo4j numpy rank-bm25 rapidfuzz requests
  export GROQ_API_KEY="gsk_..."
"""

